meta {
  name: Get Last Trip
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/trip/last
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Get Last Trip

  This request is used to get the last trip. This request interacts with the MySQL database, and has a protected routes.

  ## Responses

  **200 — Trip fetched successfully**
```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "trip fetched",
    "data": {
      "trip_destination_name": "Location A",
      "trip_destination_coordinate": "-6.177362076836449,106.79156507985539",
      "driver_username": "jhondoe",
      "vehicle_type": "City Car",
      "vehicle_plate_number": "EY 28 BK",
      "created_at": "2025-09-05 00:00:00"
    }
  }
```

  **401 — protected route need to include sign in token as authorization bearer**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "you need to include the authorization token from login"
  }
```

  **404 — trip failed to fetched**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "trip not found"
  }
```

  **500 — Internal Server Error**
```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "something wrong. please contact admin"
  }
```
}